<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Pahuli huli Filemooni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemoni mbaahi a Pahuli, iluumbi hya Yisu. Pahuli miyabisa nde Musamu wu Mubwe. Humbisa uyuha mambu ma Pahuli, Filemoni asobi mbiili mu udukala Yisu. Nde aba muutu nga busina, wu aba na baviha. Onesimi, mumosi mu baviha ba nde, abati nzo a pfumu a nde. Nde abwani na Pahuli hutso a kondaayi, hu nde haba. Mu taangu mo yiina, Onesimi kaka asiingi Yisu we Mufuhisi a nde. Pahuli afutili Onesimi huli pfumu a nde na muhanda. Buni Filemoni huyaka Onesimi?</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Pahuli huli Filemoni baasonehe kaka huli libundu li libaakuukama mu nzo a nde (itsudu hya 2). Ngu musamu muhanda mo wunuuwu, ni dyambu li laatala libundu loosi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu taangu mo yiina, busina bu ipfumu hya bisu Looma, bwaba bwasingama mu mumbungu baviha. Ibadi hi litangu la baatu mu musyenge, aba fula-fula baviha. Bo baakasala bisalu byosi, na idiingu hya bo aba ubaahwada mu bapfumu ba bo. Tsyembili muviha wu miibata aba yinono; fula-fula lipfu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu muhanda a nde, Pahuli li mu uvondo huli Filemoni mu uyaka Onesimi we mwaana a ngu a nde wu litondo. Mu tooni ati, mu Kristo boosi baka baana ba ngu, tso ba bali bunyanga, tso ba bali baviha. Ka Pahuli li mu uvondo nde lo na kulimini. Nde tondi ti Filemoni nde mwakulu akuhasa lo, we bu huli matsimi ma mutima a nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bakristo baatsomi, a baabeedi na matwala ma usobo mikele mya mbiili a baatu ba taangu abo, mu mawasa ve. Ka imiinu mu Yisu Kristo, hili mu usobo mbiili a baatu mu pasi tungi. Ngu musamu litondo, utwala mu usobo mbiili a muutu-muutu, buuve mbiili a tsi yitindala.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Me Pahuli, ikondaayi hya Kristo Yisu, na mwaana a ngu Timoteho, lili mu usonehele muhanda mo wunuuwu huli Filemoni, tsyengi a bisu wu litondo. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />Bisu lili mu usonehele nde ka huli Apiya, kedi a bisu, huli Arikiipe, mbaahi a bisu wu mudiingu, na huli libundu li lili mu ukuukama mu nzo a we. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Nyaha hyese na hyenze bi bimati huli Nzambi Taata a bisu na Pfumu Yisu Kristo, biba na benu.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Litondo na imiinu bya Filemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Filemoni, me ndi mu upfutala matondo taangu yoosi huli Nzambi, na ubaasambila mu we. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Mu tooni ati, me ndi mu unzuha tsangu yi litondo li we li mu umweese huli bangidi boosi, na yi imiinu hya we mu Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Me ndi mu upondo huli Nzambi, mana itwadi hi hili mu upfuuta bisu a benu mu imiinu, himonehele. Itwadi mo hina himonehele, mu mavaanga ma mabwe moosi ma luukuhasa mu usalila Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Mwana a ngu a me, litondo li we amweesi laaviidi me kinya yindahi na kwadili. Mu litondo mo liina, we ahwadisi kaka mitima mya ba banzuhisini ŋa hati li libundu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miivolele Onesimi mileembe huli Filemoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi na bunyanga bu Kristo hamiiva me, mu uyabisa we isalu hi we afwana mu usa. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Me Pahuli, wu aka inunu na ikondaayi mu tooni a Kristo Yisu, me ndi mu upondo huli we, isiha imosi. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Me pondi huli we, mu uvanga lilibwe mu tooni a Onisimi, nde wu aka mwaana a me hutso a kondaayi huni. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Tsomi nde a haba na tsoongo huli we ve. Ka bunuubu nde ka na tsoongo huli we na huli me.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Bunuubu, me ndi mu upfutala we nde. Nde wu aka we mutima a me. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Me kiikeelese nde mana nde akumbasa me ŋa mbuha a we, bu me ndi mu kondaayi mu tooni a Tsaangu Yimbwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ka me a hatondi usa pasi isiha hwavele ufuula matsimi ma we ve. Mana we a havanga lilibwe mu kwamisa. Ka we vanga lo mu mutima wu ayaluha.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Peleve Onisimi amiitahuha na we mu mwaana taangu hole, mana nde akwilala mu ubweba na we. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Ka bunuubu, nde a hasaali muviha ve, ka nde afulala tso muviha, mu tooni ati, nde li mwaana a ngu wu afulala talu na litondo. Eye, nde li na tsongo huli me! Ka nde sa afulala tsongo huli we mu busalili na mu bumwana bwa ngu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Buuna, tso we li wu abaambana na me, yaka nde we bu we uyaka me mwakulu. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Tso nde havangila we lilibi, buuve tso nde li na mukanu a we, suusa byo mutso a biita la me. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Me mwakulu ndi mu utsonehe mambu mo maniima mu hoho hwa me: «Me Pahuli, me tsa pfuta we mukanu mowuna.» We ayaba bubwe-bubwe ti, we na mukanu a me. Mukanu mo, ni moonyi a we. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Eye, mwaana a ngu a me, kumbasa me mu musamu mo wunuuwu mu litondo la Pfumu. Hwadisa mutima a me mu itwadi na Kristo. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Me ndi mu utsindaha we muhanda mo wunuuwu, na hiitu ti we sa vanga ma me ndi mu upondo huli we. Na me nzaabi ti we sa kuhasa hu hwafulala, bi me ndi mu upondo we. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Titswene, vangila me itini hya nzo hi ubwamina. Me ndi na hiitu ti mu tooni masambulu ma benu, me tsa nzapfutahala benu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafasi wu uli mutso a kondaayi na me mu tooni a Yisu Kristo, tsindihi we mabwehe. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Malako, Arisitake, Demasi na Luuka, bambaahi ba me ba isalu, bo kaka batsindihi we mabwehe. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu Yisu Kristo hiba na benu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>